    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "This is an everyday occurrence during the Obsidian Festival. After all, the concerts are one of the most beloved things about the Festival."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "The major concert starts at night in Garrison Amusement Park, while at daytime, you can see small concerts in every district."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I'm already getting pumped up!;This kind of music is a bit intense for me...",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Haha, but you know what, I studied in Victoria, so I prefer more elegant music and classical."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Even though classical artists are invited to the Obsidian Festival, this kind of music is more attractive to the tourists."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "It started trending the last few years or so. When I was younger, jazz was all the rage."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I love spending the day on 2nd Avenue. With a few books with me, I can stay an entire day in one of the caf\u00e9s."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Listening to music, having\u00a0 a cup of green tea, and enjoying the sea breeze..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "It was then that I thought, Siesta must be the best city in the world."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You must really love this city.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Of course! This is all possible due to the support I have, including from my family."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Besides my father, someone close to me works at the City Hall here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "You'll meet her soon. With her help, it will be much easier to determine how serious the problem is!"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "It sounds like you really trust her.;Are you talking about your mother?",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "My mother died when she gave birth to me. After that, my father buried himself in his work."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Since I was little, she has been taking care of me as my bodyguard. Her name is Schwarz."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Whenever my father was busy with work, she patiently kept my company. Though we're not related by blood, she treats me just like a sister would, so I consider her to be an important part of my family."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I'll introduce you to her when we meet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Look, Doctor, we're almost there. Let's head straight in."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
