    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard",
        "text": "Mister Cronin, Miss Ceylon would like to see you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "What important matters bring you to the City Hall, milady?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Everyone is busy organizing the festival right now, so I'm afraid there is little time to spare."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Cronin, I'll get to the point. The Siesta Volcano is likely to erupt soon. I can't say exactly when, but it could be as soon as the next few days."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "In other words, all the citizens and tourists will be in danger. We need to start evacuating them and help them find shelter."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "We must stop the Obsidian Festival right away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Oh milady, do you know what you're saying?"
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
            "key": "$darkness01_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Anyone else would have been driven out the moment they talked to me like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "But because you're special, I'm willing to explain it just for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "You don't have to worry about the volcano 'issue' at all. Even though I don't know where you got your information, I can assure you that it's nonsense."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "...Are you kidding me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "There's plenty of evidence that suggests that the volcano is active again and will likely erupt soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Such as?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Agitation of the Originium slugs living there, unusual changes in temperature, and a strange smell. The conclusion should be obvious."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "If you don't believe me, read the material I brought. It contains a detailed analysis and the conclusion."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Obvious? Did you go interview the Originium slugs? Or maybe the hot air, or that strange smell?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "I don't quite understand. What do these baseless numbers have to do with this so-called imminent eruption?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "All I know is, I designed the volcano observation system, the mayor built it, and it is still working well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Right now, the Siesta Volcano's parameters aren't much different from previous years. If anything, they're even more stable?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "What are you talking about? The truth is right before you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You're a Catastrophe Messenger, and you don't even know this much?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "And who exactly are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname} is from a professional organization, with colleagues who are experts in volcanology."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "These parameters were examined by the analysts from their specialized department."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "I see, I see."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "...Haha, I get it now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "So it was you bunch who managed to fool the mayor's daughter, strange visitors."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Milady, isn't it obvious? You were duped by this faceless stranger."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Cronin, what are you trying to say? You don't even believe my word?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "What I'm saying is, you've been studying abroad so you might not know this, but many people are jealous of Siesta's development."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "These kinds of people appear every year. They've tried every trick in the book to try to stop our development. Blackmail, explosions, assassinations. They've even targeted no-name people like me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Of course, this is not the first time that someone has tried to spread rumors about this so-called 'volcanic eruption.' However, it is the first time one of these rumors has even been able to deceive someone like you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "I must say, these grifters must have done their homework on the mayor. They even knew that you just returned from studying abroad."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "And look at their nerve, marching into the City Hall like they own the place."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "...You're right that I didn't know about this, but I'm telling the truth!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "There's no way I'd just trust any stranger who shows up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "As far as I can tell, there's no difference between this 'Doctor' and the swindlers I've encountered in the past."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "There's no depths to which they won't stoop in order to take away this city!"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You're jumping to conclusions...;If this is a joke, it's not very funny.",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Jumping to conclusions? Hah, that's what all you swindlers say."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "What a coincidence. I didn't find your little joke funny either."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Milady, you're still young, so things like this are bound to happen sometimes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "But don't worry, these swindlers will be punished accordingly. This, I promise you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$fesmetal_intro",
            "key": "$fesmetal_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Security."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Take them away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_020"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard",
        "text": "Yes, sir."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#3",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Cronin! You won't even listen to me now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "You won't have your way as long as I'm here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
